{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナンバリング間違えてましたね...\nすみません"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルプラネットさんで\nソロインタビューしていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/08/8045827/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://idol-planet.com/premium/201612/04-nogizaka46-9"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろ\nはっきりと\n喋ってきましたので\n是非、読んでください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"開演待機中にでも\nグッズ列待機中にでも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルプラネットさん\nいつもいつもお世話になってます！\nありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「乃木坂46 Merry Xmas Show 2016 ～アンダー単独公演～」\nでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レポはいつも通り\n終わってからになっちゃうんですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\n本当にありがとう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わった後、\n口々に「楽しかった～！」\nって言ってたよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/08/8045827/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イジリーさんも\nらりんも来てくれてたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/08/8045827/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"酒井さんも\n来てくださいました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日もライブ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セトリがね\n結構違うから\nまた別のライブをする感覚です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ります！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/08/8045827/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\nその後の沈金もかけつけます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/08/8045827/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅れちゃいますが...\n出たいんだもん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、\n九段下から代々木だと\n電車で15分程で着くと思いますよたぶん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}